        "title": "Gaming Motherboard, 2 DDR4 Memory Slots EX B460M V5 Motherboard, Integrated LAN and ALC887 7.1 Channel Sound Chip, Supports for LGA 1200 10th Gen",
        "asin": "B0DZ19W4F8",
        "depth": 0,
        "child": {},
        "description": "High Performance CPU Support: This EX B460M V5 motherboard is suitable for LGA 1200 10th gen, for Core, for Pentium, for Celeron 14nm processors, ensuring powerful performance for a wide range of applications. It's equipped with a built in for RTL8111H Gigabit LAN card for smoother network connections. Integrated the for ALC887 7.1 channel sound chip. Versatile Memory and Storage Options: With 2 DDR4 memory slots supporting 2 channel DDR4 2933, 2800, 2666, 2400, 2133MHz RAM up to 64GB, this motherboard offers ample memory capacity. It includes 4 Serial ATA III ports and 1 M.2 slot for flexible storage solutions. Comprehensive Display Connectivity: The DDR4 motherboard comes with HD multimedia interface and VGA outputs, facilitating connections to TVs and displays for an immersive HD experience. It's ideal for home, design, and gaming environments. Expandable PCI E Capability: Supporting PCI E 3.0 standards, the motherboard features 1 PCI E x16 and 2 PCI E x1 slots. These allow for expansion with dedicated graphics cards, sound cards, network cards, and other PCI E devices. Long Lasting and Stable Design: Featuring all solid capacitors and 8+24 pin power connectors, this M ATX motherboard ensures stable performance. It is built with robust PCB and metal materials, delivering durability and a longer lifespan.",
